 at  patient-derived xenograft models at  modeling cancer precision medicine  you know immune changes in  macrophages tcga  and even we'll take a look at many other  types of projects so really a lot of  projects i'm not going to go into all of  them but especially i want to kind of  highlight how this could be relevant to  some of you that might be either doing  your masters or maybe phds  in different areas so we have here an  example of olga udartseva she's a  research affiliate a postdoctoral  research affiliate at roswell park  comprehensive cancer center and this is  what she has gotten out of program like  this she says the program is very well  structured and easy to learn the skills  that i gained through the program helped  me significantly enhance the relevance  of my project by making connections  between my pre-clinical study and its  practical applications to cancer  patients so really i hope that this  would be an outcome for all of you that  decide to join this training program  so to speak more about the
 

